      "mergedPostDetails": "When using the Flying mode of the camera in VR, auto focus options will not sample from the correct point on the screen. (It seems like they might be using the wrong base position?)\nIn my testing, this can be easily reproduced by placing the camera into flying mode and moving it around the scene. Once it is moved from the old position, it will no longer be able to properly focus. \nManual focus controls work (but are obviously quite difficult to use).",
